<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>POS Trial Reminder</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family:'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; padding: 24px; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #1e293b; margin: 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 20px;">
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed); border-radius: 14px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        TW
      </div>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a;">ThriveWoo POS</h2>
      <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">Free Trial Status Notification</p>
    </div>

    <h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0;">
      Hello <%= name %> (<%= store_name %>),
    </h3>

    <div style="background: #eef2ff; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <strong style="color: #312e81; font-size: 15px;">
        <%= days_left === 1 ? 'Final Notice: Your Free Trial Ends Tomorrow' : ('Your Free Trial Ends in ' + days_left + ' Days') %>
      </strong>
      <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; color: #3730a3; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
        Your 14-day free trial of ThriveWoo POS <strong><%= plan_name %></strong> concludes on <strong><%= end_date %></strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;">
      Your vaulted payment method will be automatically billed for your chosen subscription plan ($<%= amount %> <%= currency %>) when the trial ends, ensuring your POS registers and terminal setups continue operating seamlessly.
    </p>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 20px;">
      <a href="<%= login_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 13px 32px; background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px;">
        Open POS Dashboard
      </a>
    </div>

    <div style="border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">Need to update payment tender or change plans? Sign in to your dashboard anytime before <%= end_date %>.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
